1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,600
And we understand as black people in England, we understand that our struggle, our struggle as it is connected to our homelands, whether it be Jamaica or we trace it all the way back to the African continent.

2
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:26,200
We understand that our fight is the Irish fight and the Irish fight is the Palestinians fight.

3
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:42,490
Palestinians fight is the fight of all people that have suffered under occupation, under colonialism, under imperialism.

4
00:00:42,490 --> 00:00:47,490
We understand that. We understand that.

